  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ペンケースが閉まらないと思ったら\r\nファスナーが壊れてたみたいで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そりゃあ閉まらないよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そのままだと中身が落ちちゃいますよね\r\n何かまとめるものとか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、中身はひとまず輪ゴムで留めとくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "でも、そのペンケース\r\nお気に入りだったんじゃ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まあ、気に入ってたし使い勝手もよかったけど……\r\nそこそこ古くなってたからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "買い替え時なんだと思うことにするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010050"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは、気にしてくれてありがとうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもほら、\r\n新しくいいペンケースが見つかるかもしれないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "手に馴染むものもいいけど……\r\n新しいものを試すいい機会だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "新しい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
