      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、新しいといえば、学生の間ではどういうものが\r\n新しい……流行のものなのか、気になってきてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうですね……\r\n駅前のお店、とか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、どんなお店なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "オリジナルのキーホルダーが\r\n作れるところみたいで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お店の前にわたしと同じくらいの年の子たちが\r\n並んでるのは、よく見ます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、自分だけのアイテムってやつか\r\nそれは流行りそうだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、好きな色、好きな柄のアイテムって\r\nやっぱり嬉しいかなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "市販のものから選んでもいいけど……\r\nカスタマイズできるのは特別感がありそうだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "な、なるほど……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "たしかに\r\nそれは、特別かもですね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010140"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何年前から古いって呼ぶんだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "十年一昔とも言うし……\r\nそれくらい……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、確かに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "でも……流行りのものとかって、１年くらいで\r\n古いって言われたりもしますよね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー……食べものや服なんかは\r\nサイクルが早いかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでいて、10年前にも流行ってたものが再流行、\r\nとかもあるから、不思議だよなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そうですね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
