    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あんまり、頻繁にものを買い替えないので……\r\nお気に入りを長く、使うことが多いかもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "が、学年が上がったりとか\r\nそういう節目で変えることはあるんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201301/2022013010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、小糸はもの持ちがよさそうだもんなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022013010270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "も、もの持ちというか……",
